{"3150160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Another Pint", "steam_appid": 3150160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/5cf0ce1a36af5065308a321d3e858b81.avif?t=1788080996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras_big/5cf0ce1a36af5065308a321d3e858b81.webp?t=1788080996 width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/38bec11ffec493116ef2e26cdf0eccdf.poster.avif?t=1788080996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/38bec11ffec493116ef2e26cdf0eccdf.webm?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/38bec11ffec493116ef2e26cdf0eccdf.mp4?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like them bright and clean or damp and musty? Whether you want yours to be grandiose or cozy, build and decorate your tavern as you wish, and run it as you see fit. Just keep in mind, your decisions will affect what patrons you attract, as well as what they think of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/486d0a9eb2dfe6b4b3cf06fb966ac9e6.avif?t=1788080996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras_big/486d0a9eb2dfe6b4b3cf06fb966ac9e6.webp?t=1788080996 width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/b1f142fb1bfb5360954e5b5ada62317c.poster.avif?t=1788080996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/b1f142fb1bfb5360954e5b5ada62317c.webm?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/b1f142fb1bfb5360954e5b5ada62317c.mp4?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s a tavern without drink? Combine different ingredients and experiment with various processes to create the perfect menu for your customers. From herbal teas, to ales, to wines, customize your selection and your prices to best fit your many picky clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/6f06a90a06d5dd8ef566c6d80b8b4b2d.avif?t=1788080996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras_big/6f06a90a06d5dd8ef566c6d80b8b4b2d.webp?t=1788080996 width=1560 height=219 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/98be3de4405dc249d7e942e40f6a5a5d.poster.avif?t=1788080996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/98be3de4405dc249d7e942e40f6a5a5d.webm?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/98be3de4405dc249d7e942e40f6a5a5d.mp4?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who’s that puking in the corner? Get to know a dynamic and expanding cast of patrons. Learn their preferences, build relationships, get quests, trade, and more. Should you build enough rapport with your favorites, have them join your team and employ them at the tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/ac8fc7b0030d94cdfe0e939aafe0164d.avif?t=1788080996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras_big/ac8fc7b0030d94cdfe0e939aafe0164d.webp?t=1788080996 width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/f9b6260bf6f1acdc5ba7e1dcd9e32e2c.poster.avif?t=1788080996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/f9b6260bf6f1acdc5ba7e1dcd9e32e2c.webm?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/f9b6260bf6f1acdc5ba7e1dcd9e32e2c.mp4?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the tavern’s closed and dark night has given way to daylight, the island calls! Explore the outpost and beyond in search of new ways to improve your tavern. Discover dozens of ingredients to gather and farm, unlock new furniture and decorations, and maybe uncover a secret or two along the way…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/e7f8f21744b58afbb834fad5930ac83d.avif?t=1788080996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras_big/e7f8f21744b58afbb834fad5930ac83d.webp?t=1788080996 width=1560 height=219 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/f97c50b91028f9f3c488c51ee15f823a.poster.avif?t=1788080996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/f97c50b91028f9f3c488c51ee15f823a.webm?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/f97c50b91028f9f3c488c51ee15f823a.mp4?t=1788080996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And who are you? The people in your tavern and the world around it will treat you and respond differently depending on who you are and what you excel at. You can edit your looks, pick your background and motivation, and assign your stats as you desire, so choose wisely. Or don't, it's your funeral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/a07caed4dad465fef5da0b0e08eabad5.avif?t=1788080996\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras/5cf0ce1a36af5065308a321d3e858b81.avif?t=1788080996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150160/extras_big/5cf0ce1a36af5065308a321d3e858b81.webp?t=1788080996 width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span 